  "hints": [
    "A 3-input NOR gate can be used as a 2-input NOR gate by connecting the same signal to two of its inputs.",
    "For the NOR implementation, generate (A + B)' and (C + D)' using two gates of the 7427.",
    "Use the third NOR gate to combine the two complemented sum terms. One intermediate signal may be connected to two inputs of the final 3-input NOR gate.",
    "For the NAND implementation, use De Morgan's theorem to construct the OR terms A + B and C + D using NAND gates.",
    "Compare the total number of gates required by the two implementations."
